        "category": "class",
        "description": {
            "value": "<p>Your innate power can shut down other magic. You gain the Dismantle Spell spellshift.</p>\n<p><strong>Spellshift—Dismantle Spell</strong> You attempt to counteract a spell or at least suppress its effect for a time.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The spell is counteracted if its rank is no more than 1 higher than half your level rounded up.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The effects of the spell are suppressed until the start of your next turn. If the spell has a duration that is measured in rounds, its duration is extended by 1 round. If the spell does not have a duration, it targets the same creature or area as though it had just been cast at the start of your next turn.</p>"
        },
